Figma Changes → Analysis (16906:5168), every version below v5 (which
shows no sample analyses by design), staging and production. The chart's
axis is the five mood faces instead of percentages and the projections
are grey dashes; 'What helped me?' is a list of rows that open to the
effect, three shown with Show more beyond; the Next chapter section is
gone; 'Since yesterday' reads 'Since last week'. v1's Analytics tab now
opens the analyses too. RELEASES.analysisV2, true on both sites.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
